 "transcript": [
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"We have not the money to support them both,\"",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"There is no end to the money they spend in the town.\"",
  "[action] Chen Fu gives money to his sons.",
  "[says] Chen Fu's sons are ungrateful.",
  "Chen Fu: \"Well, and I will give the money to either of you, but you may as well divide it between you if you do not need it all, since it is your land that you are farming.\"",
  "the eldest son: \"Yes, and we have not been to see our old father for a long time.\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"I do not need to see my sons,\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu expresses his disdain for his son.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"Well, and we have not come to see you because you have been a man and you have had no sons to come and see you.\"",
  "[says] (to Chen Fu) The eldest son shows his pride.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I have never seen a man like you in the town, and I have never been a man like you.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"There are men who live for nothing but for women and for the pleasures of the town, and you are a man who has a house and a wife and enough food and enough money to support them all and you are content.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son looks at his brother.",
  "[says] Chen Fu expresses his dislike of his sons.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu expresses his dislike of his eldest son.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu turns away and looks at the second son.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"I will tell you all about it. I know everything. I saw you doing it and I saw you spending it and I saw where you spent it, and I have even told my mother and she says you are a disgrace to us and you are going to have to go away because you are too idle.\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) Chen Fu shouts at his second son.",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu) The eldest son looks at his father and walks away."
